      "value": "VRChat Feedback (Canny) isn't generally a place for support, nor does there seem to really be a bug to report here. That's the beauty (and horror) of user generated content, creators can do almost anything with avatars.\n\nOther users won't be able to replicate your experience without an avatar ID (or at least a name of the avatar and its uploader, if it's indexed publicly on avatar search worlds). ([How to find IDs and Identifiers in VRChat (for Users, Worlds & Avatars)](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408181867027-How-to-find-IDs-and-Identifiers-in-VRChat-for-Users-Worlds-Avatars))\n\nYou can reset your avatar to a default avatar: ([Unable to switch out of an avatar](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360060847634-Unable-to-switch-out-of-an-avatar))\n\n[VRChat Helpdesk](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us) exists for support questions, and [VRChat Ask Forum](https://ask.vrchat.com/) for community discussion. You can submit a moderation request on VRChat Helpdesk as well, if you find a malicious avatar.",
